        "Combines diagrams, designs, and technical decisions",
        "Uses Specs and the Figma agent to simplify implementation"
      ],
      "design_implication": "When a designer pulls scattered technical documentation and architecture diagrams into a live canvas review, finding alignment across disciplines becomes less about searching wikis and more about inspecting the shared source of truth. As specification and generation merge into a single canvas artifact, review shifts from asking what was intended to verifying what is built. Start by mapping all external technical specs directly onto your primary design file before the next engineering sync.",
